    "group": "Lords of the Forge",
    "summary": "Whenever this unit gets **selected to shoot** in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), you can roll a D6 if it is not [battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock). On a 2+, pick one of these:\n\n- an enemy **VEHICLE** unit up to 12\" from this unit takes a **[battle-shock roll](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)** at -1; each unit can be picked this way only once per turn\n- this unit's ranged attacks do not stop it being **[hidden](vsdata:core-rule/hidden)**",
